{
  "id": "moving_mirror",
  "name": "The Moving Mirror of Fulling and Davies",
  "short_name": "Moving mirror",
  "description": "Flat spacetime in two dimensions that ends at a perfectly reflecting mirror on a chosen world line, with a massless quantum field to its right. A mirror that accelerates radiates, and one whose world line approaches a light ray sends out a steady thermal flux, Hawking's radiation with no curvature anywhere.",
